is between “nothing” and “empty space.”

00:06:56.960 --> 00:07:00.280
Empty space is just space and time completely
devoid of matter.

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:03.400
Nothingness is a complete lack of even space
or time.

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:04.680
Literally nothing!

